# DBeaver ERD / Data Models
# 
# Save your ERD exports in this folder:
# - .png or .svg files (ERD images for documentation)
# - .erd files (DBeaver ERD project files)
# - SQL exports from ERD designs
#
# Workflow:
# 1. Design your model in DBeaver ERD
# 2. Export image here for documentation
# 3. Export SQL to sql/migrations/ folder
# 4. Commit both
